    (date "2026-11-25")
    (rev "B")
    (company "DIY modular outdoor monitor")
    (comment 1 "Not the AirGradient V1.3 PCB. Off-the-shelf modules only.")
    (comment 2 "LOLIN32 Lite: SDA GPIO19, SCL GPIO23, SPS30 EN GPIO26, VBAT ADC GPIO36/VP.")
