  (text "Variant A LOLIN32 Lite: SDA GPIO19, SCL GPIO23, SPS30 EN GPIO26 (active high), VBAT ADC GPIO36/VP (ADC1)." (at 12.7 10.16 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 14ec374a-a3e9-4d28-b3d2-6fc440809237)
  )
  (text "JP1 FIT = run from U2. OPEN JP1 before the ESP32 USB plug. Never USB and the 3V3 pin at once." (at 12.7 12.7 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid c00d9eed-64b3-4a98-aef8-e66195609f27)
  )
  (text "Do not tie +5V_SPS to the ESP32 5V pin. I2C is 100 kHz at 3.3 V. R4/R5 = 4.7k to +3V3. Never pull SDA/SCL to 5 V." (at 12.7 15.24 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid adc85334-50b1-4a2d-9cd1-be24fca00a1e)
  )
  (text "Fit U6 SCD30 (0x61, SEL=GND) OR U7 SCD41 (0x62), not both. U8 SEL=GND selects I2C 0x69 before power-up." (at 12.7 17.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid fb05eea9-1423-42d7-9340-5bcce9463182)
  )
  (text "EN is active high through R3. RT1 replaces the module's fixed 10k on TS. Set U2 to 3.3 V before connecting it." (at 12.7 20.32 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid af63355d-fa0b-47be-bc2d-9098152bef42)
  )
  (text "Leave GPIO3, GPIO4 and GPIO5 open. Also leave open: GPIO0/2/12/15 (strap), GPIO22 (LED, active low), GPIO1/TX, GPIO3/RX, GPIO6-11 (flash), GPIO4 and GPIO5." (at 12.7 22.86 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top))
    (uuid d512e94c-238f-431e-b7e2-210b873a18d4)
  )

  (sheet_instances
    (path "/" (page "1"))
  )
)
